Package: ufi-phone
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Kuvatov Ruslan Baxtiyarovich <ufi-sms-telegram-forwarder@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Ruskuv1708/ufi-sms-telegram-forwarder
Depends: libc6 (>= @MIN_GLIBC@), zlib1g
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils
Description: Desktop calls and SMS through a compatible UFI modem
 UFI Phone connects to the authenticated private-LAN gateway on a compatible
 Qualcomm-based UFI003 LTE modem. It supports cellular calls, two-way call
 audio, SMS conversations, a keypad, and local call history.
